        melee: [{ name: "Gun butt", atk: 3, hit: "4+", dmg: "2/3", wr: "-" }],
        abilities: ["Loadout: a lasrifle or lascarbine, plus a gun butt.", "Grenadier: It can use frag, krak and smoke grenades without using up equipment, and gets +1 to Hit with frag and krak grenades.", "Melta Mine: It carries your Melta Mine marker and can pick it up. After placing it, it gets a free Dash. It can't place it in enemy control range.", "Proximity Mine: The first time the mine is in another operative's control range, remove it and inflict 2D6+3 damage on that operative. If it survives, its action ends. This operative never sets it off."],
